text":"ずっと一緒にいたら\n有り難みとか温かみが\n分からないものですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こうやって離れてみて\n分かったことも沢山あるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも\nいつでも帰れる場所があるって\n本当に幸せなことだ( ˊᵕˋ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH934C72G3D58T99C55VT71","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はここまで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいばい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なな"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-6436":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/10/8854557/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"blogの写メをとるため、自撮りしてたら......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/10/8854557/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"画面に『読み取れませんでした』的なこと書いてあって、"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/10/8854557/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ん？』\nって思ったら、カメラ機能じゃなくてバーコードリーダーだった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/10/8854557/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも、マヤです←吉田麻也選手のblogの始まり方をまねして見ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/10/8854557/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では気を取り直して"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/10/8854557/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ今回も始まりました〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/